OL,3,GNEWSASpeeding driver jailed for killing
OL,4,Aman on pavement
OL,5,
OL,6,FA speeding driver has been jailed after
OL,7,Fmounting the pavement and killing a
OL,8,F"brilliant, kind and generous"
OL,9,Fpedestrian in Birmingham.
OL,11,FShanise Hussain, 27, was driving an
OL,12,FAudi A3 on Great Hampton Street on 21
OL,13,FJuly 2024 when she lost control of the
OL,14,Fvehicle, hitting two passers-by.
OL,16,FMaurice Middleton, 68, died at the
OL,17,Fscene, West Midlands Police said, with
OL,18,Fa second pedestrian suffering minor
OL,19,Fhead and hand injuries in the incident.
OL,23,APub: 10-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
