OL,3,GNEWSASpeeding driver jailed for killing
OL,4,Aman on pavement
OL,5,
OL,6,FHussain of West Drive, Handsworth, was
OL,7,Ffound guilty of causing death by
OL,8,Fdangerous driving following a trial at
OL,9,FBirmingham Crown Court and sentenced to
OL,10,Ffour years and six months in prison on
OL,11,F3 September.
